  "body": "[COEP](https://wicg.github.io/cross-origin-embedder-policy/#corp-check) added additional `cross-origin` value to CORP. But CORP already has `same-site` value, which includes cross-origin resources (cross-origin but same-site resources). We should change `cross-origin` to `cross-site` so that we are all aligned with the meaning of consent added by COEP.\r\n",
